# Invasion Tactics {4}{G}: "When this enchantment enters, creatures you control get +2/+2 until end of turn" (CR 611.2c, 514.2) and "Whenever one or more Allies
# you control deal combat damage to a player, draw a card" (CR 510.2, 603.2c). Bot1 casts Stonework Puma (a 2/2 Ally) on turn 1 and, on turn 3, Expedition Envoy
